# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# WaveSend – files Git should NEVER track
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Personal data: contact lists, reports, backups ──
# (These hold other people's phone numbers. Keep them off GitHub.)
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.ods
*.vcf
*backup*.json
*wavesend-backup*
*report*.csv
contacts/
reports/
backups/
exports/
# Allow sample/template files you deliberately create:
!samples/
!samples/**
!sample_contacts.csv

# ── Packaged builds (re-create them when needed) ──
*.zip
*.crx
*.pem
dist/
build/
release/

# ── Secrets ──
.env
.env.*
*.key

# ── Node / tooling (if you ever add tests or a build step) ──
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
coverage/

# ── Windows / macOS clutter ──
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# ── Editors ──
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
